Against the build it replaces
-----------------------------

The nvault_amxx.dll H9 shipped before, from the reTS AMX Mod X build (1.10.0-manual):
163840 bytes, SHA256 20676371CD297DD518F679DBDCE9B4C42FCC1A1A64D94A56C04EE160495F44BE,
kept as nvault_amxx.dll.bak_slots beside this file. To go back, copy that over nvault_amxx.dll.

On servers of 32 slots or fewer nothing changes: the tables are longer, and every loop and
bound in them still stops at the server's maxplayers.
